WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,540
Round the clock duty

2
00:00:02,390 --> 00:00:04,190
Prevent people from other buildings from entering the palace.

3
00:00:04,450 --> 00:00:05,730
Once you find someone coming

4
00:00:05,990 --> 00:00:07,270
Just knock on the stairwell

5
00:00:07,770 --> 00:00:09,830
or other metal objects notify everyone

6
00:00:10,750 --> 00:00:12,030
When people on other floors wake up

7
00:00:12,550 --> 00:00:14,590
Use this method to notify senior people as well.

8
00:00:15,610 --> 00:00:17,150
The rewards I just mentioned are always valid

9
00:00:17,890 --> 00:00:18,910
drive away an enemy

10
00:00:19,430 --> 00:00:20,710
Reward food for five people

11
00:00:22,110 --> 00:00:23,390
If there is no attack

12
00:00:23,910 --> 00:00:26,470
Even if you are on duty, there will be food for one person every day.

13
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:28,580
But someone else has to choose first

14
00:00:29,620 --> 00:00:42,460
And the portion can’t be guaranteed. I’ll leave it up to you to arrange it, no problem, Zhang Yi.

15
00:00:42,980 --> 00:00:44,500
Did you forget our food?
